msgstr "Terhubung. Perangkat WhatsApp %s siap mengirim."

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:159
#, php-format
msgid "API Key is valid, but the device status is \"%s\". Reconnect it in the NgirimWA dashboard."
msgstr "API Key valid, tetapi status perangkat \"%s\". Hubungkan ulang di dashboard NgirimWA."

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:178
msgid "Channels managed by your device:"
msgstr "Channel yang dikelola perangkat Anda:"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:178
msgid "This device does not own or manage any channel yet."
msgstr "Perangkat ini belum memiliki atau menjadi admin channel mana pun."

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:192
msgid "Add at least one recipient and save the settings first."
msgstr "Isi minimal satu penerima lalu simpan pengaturan dulu."

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:198
#, php-format
msgid "Test notification from %s via NgirimWA WP Notify."
msgstr "Notifikasi uji dari %s lewat NgirimWA WP Notify."

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:207
msgid "accepted"
msgstr "diterima"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:208 includes/class-apivro-wp-notify.php:117
msgid "Accepted by NgirimWA."
msgstr "Diterima NgirimWA."

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:229
msgid "Notifications are sent automatically in the background when a post is published."
msgstr "Notifikasi dikirim otomatis di latar belakang saat artikel diterbitkan."

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:236
msgid "Enter your NgirimWA API Key"
msgstr "Masukkan API Key NgirimWA"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:238
msgid "Current key:"
msgstr "Key saat ini:"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:240
msgid "Get it from the NgirimWA dashboard (dash.ngirimwa.com) → Devices → API Keys. Messages are sent from the device linked to this key."
msgstr "Ambil di dashboard NgirimWA (dash.ngirimwa.com) → Perangkat → Kunci API. Pesan dikirim dari perangkat yang terhubung dengan key ini."

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:257
msgid "Separate with commas or new lines. WhatsApp number: 628123456789 · Group: …@g.us · Channel: …@newsletter (use \"Load My Channels\" below)."
msgstr "Pisahkan dengan koma atau baris baru. Nomor WhatsApp: 628123456789 · Grup: …@g.us · Channel: …@newsletter (pakai \"Ambil Daftar Channel\" di bawah)."

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:260
msgid "Channel posts need the Pro or Enterprise plan, and the device number must be the owner or an admin of the channel. Each post counts as 1 message."
msgstr "Posting ke channel butuh paket Pro atau Enterprise, dan nomor perangkat harus pemilik atau admin channel. Setiap postingan dihitung 1 pesan."

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:271
msgid "Send the featured image with the message (the text becomes the caption)"
msgstr "Kirim gambar unggulan bersama pesan (teks menjadi caption)"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:273
msgid "The image must be publicly reachable over HTTPS."
msgstr "Gambar harus bisa diakses publik lewat HTTPS."

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:282
msgid "Use Excerpt"
msgstr "Pakai Ringkasan"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:283 includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:307
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Kustom"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:284
msgid "Title and link only"
msgstr "Judul dan tautan saja"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:288
msgid "Shown before the post link. Example: Baca selengkapnya 👇"
msgstr "Tampil sebelum tautan artikel. Contoh: Baca selengkapnya 👇"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:297
msgid "Shown after the post link. Line breaks are kept. Leave empty to disable."
msgstr "Tampil setelah tautan artikel. Baris baru dipertahankan. Kosongkan untuk menonaktifkan."

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:306
msgid "Smart Delay (random 3–8 seconds)"
msgstr "Jeda Pintar (acak 3–8 detik)"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:311
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "detik"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:313
msgid "Gap between recipients. Sending runs in the background (WP-Cron), so publishing is never slowed down."
msgstr "Jarak antar penerima. Pengiriman berjalan di latar belakang (WP-Cron), jadi menerbitkan artikel tidak melambat."

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:339
msgid "Channel"
msgstr "Channel"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:339
msgid "Channel ID"
msgstr "ID Channel"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:343
msgid "Add to Recipients"
msgstr "Tambah ke Penerima"

#: includes/class-apivro-wp-notify-admin.php:345
msgid "Click \"Add to Recipients\", then Save Settings."
msgstr "Klik \"Tambah ke Penerima\", lalu Simpan Pengaturan."

